======================================================================
KEY INSIGHTS
======================================================================
Highest conversion rate: Monday (3.00%)
Lowest conversion rate:  Wednesday (2.00%)
total_ads is heavily right-skewed (mean 24.8 vs. median 13.0, max 2065) — a small number of users see very many ads.
Sample sizes per most_ads_day group are large (77k-93k), and with n this large the t-test's reliance on the CLT for the sampling distribution of the mean holds even though the raw distribution is skewed.
